Skills: Databases

Purpose:
  Database technology skills organized by technology and competency layers.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @postgresql/
   3  @mongodb/
   4  @redis/
   5  @mysql/

Modes:
  LEARN    — learn database fundamentals
  APPLY    — apply database skills to schema
  REVIEW   — review database skills
  UPGRADE  — propose database skill upgrade

Rules:
  [D1]  Skills MUST be organized by database technology.
  [D2]  Each database MUST have L1-L4 layers.
  [D3]  Skills MUST cover schema design and optimization.
  [D4]  Skills MUST be loaded on demand.
  [D5]  Database skills MUST NOT contain project-specific content.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd

  Resolve:
    postgresql
    mongodb
    redis
    mysql

Navigation:
  Databases: @databases/INDEX.sdd
  PostgreSQL: @databases/postgresql/INDEX.sdd
  MongoDB: @databases/mongodb/INDEX.sdd
  Redis: @databases/redis/INDEX.sdd
  MySQL: @databases/mysql/INDEX.sdd

